## 5. Seen split, epoch-9 checkpoints (6217 queries)

| Subset | n | EDT cyl / ctrl | C50 cyl / ctrl | T60 cyl / ctrl | Significant (cyl better) |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| All | 6217 | 0.0337 / 0.0347 | 0.873 / 0.895 | 6.84 / 6.92 | EDT, C50, T60, MSE, loss |
